Last year, a game called 'Destiny Impact' came out. It's an open-world ARPG game that's so amazing on its own even without the gacha mechanics. He loved the game and character so much he spent every single hours of his free time on it. All his money is poured into 'whaling' the characters that the devs pumped out. He's completely and utterly addicted into this game.

